From: Androlinzberg maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] RenderEngine: select the host GL/Ganesh backend

Keep pinned rendering, threaded dispatch, filters, color transforms and fence
handling. Linux uses the shared GBM EGL display and has no Android task-profile
cgroups. Unsupported Vulkan, Graphite and protected contexts fail creation;
the GL-only Skia build must not retain unresolved Vulkan factory calls.

Correct two verbose DependencyMonitor log arguments exposed by the debug build.

--- a/libs/renderengine/RenderEngine.cpp
+++ b/libs/renderengine/RenderEngine.cpp
@@ -17,8 +17,6 @@
 #include <renderengine/RenderEngine.h>
 
 #include "renderengine/ExternalTexture.h"
-#include "skia/GaneshVkRenderEngine.h"
-#include "skia/GraphiteVkRenderEngine.h"
